OL,3,GNEWSAPeople told to keep windows closed
OL,4,Aover chemical leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Magheralin in County Down
OL,7,Fwere advised to keep their windows and
OL,8,Fdoors closed over what the police
OL,9,Fdescribed as a suspected chemical leak
OL,10,Fearlier on Tuesday.
OL,12,FThree fire appliances were sent to the
OL,13,Fscene on the Steps Road in the village
OL,14,Fat 13:45 BST but have since left.
OL,16,FEarlier the Northern Ireland Fire and
OL,17,FRescue Service (NIFRS) said it was
OL,18,Fdealing with a "hazardous incident
OL,19,Finvolving gas" and advised people to
OL,20,Favoid the area.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
